{"cluster_id": "C-1982", "topic": "The dangling precommit fix uses a", "target": "architecture/garbage-collection", "member_ids": ["B007-063", "B035-030"], "canonical_claim": "The dangling-precommit fix uses a fold-side, watermark-keyed force-Read: `ShardCoverage` records the minimal live precommit binding, and `computeDiscoverDecisions` overrides `Skip` when that precommit is provably dead.; To reclaim abandoned precommits on parked shards, `Gc::computeDiscoverDecisions` force-reads a token-stable shard when its sealed minimal live precommit is dead according to the mount watermark, allowing `reclaimAbandonedPrecommit` to emit the owner removal.", "issue_ids": ["S30"], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-07-cas-dangling-precommit-manifest-orphan-fix.md#architecture", "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-07-cas-dangling-precommit-manifest-orphan-fix.md#goal", "utils/ca-soak/scenarios/BACKLOG.md#L1251-L1287"]}
