{"cluster_id": "C-1995", "topic": "The recommended root cause fix for", "target": "architecture/garbage-collection", "member_ids": ["B015-078", "B040-037"], "canonical_claim": "The recommended root-cause fix for the fetch-by-relink residual is a liveness re-check at the GC pre-CAS `deleteExact` site rather than restoring blanket promote-time HEAD and `loadMeta` probes.; With only per-key deleteExact available, catalog-token and fence credentials must be revalidated immediately before each delete rather than once per multi-key batch", "issue_ids": ["#42", "#43"], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/reports/2026-07-14-cas-adoptevidence-relink-lifecycle-exposure.md#fix-direction-if-the-fetch-by-relink-residual-is-judged-worth-closing", "docs/superpowers/reports/2026-07-28-ref-rework-reviews/codex_plans_r1_findings.md#L40-L42"]}
