{"cluster_id": "C-2004", "topic": "CasDecommission ManifestDebrisPhaseFailuresWarnAndContinue should inject S3_ERROR not", "target": "architecture/garbage-collection", "member_ids": ["B020-011"], "canonical_claim": "`CasDecommission.ManifestDebrisPhaseFailuresWarnAndContinue` should inject `S3_ERROR`, not `LOGICAL_ERROR`, because `sweepNamespace` catches `Exception` without inspecting the error code and the test models unavailable backend protection-view access rather than an invalid invariant.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/reports/2026-07-18-logical-error-asan-abort-triage.md#L42-L44", "docs/superpowers/reports/2026-07-18-logical-error-asan-abort-triage.md#L74-L91"]}
